findings.body:
The PR wires a new config knob end to end, but the tests only check that some `local_hostname` kwarg is present. `ANY` matches `None`, so the default path and the override path are indistinguishable.

::diff{file="api/tests/unit_tests/libs/test_smtp_client.py" lines="17-22"}

A test that sets `SMTP_LOCAL_HOSTNAME` and asserts the value reaches the constructor and both `ehlo` calls would actually verify the feature. Without it, a regression that ignores the config value still passes the suite.
